                        <p><strong>Cuddles and love</strong></p>
                        <p>Not all cats are fans of cuddling, but those who are will love a daily snuggle session. Make sure to have a blanket on your lap to protect yourself from those sharp claws while they knead, and then enjoy some quality bonding time with your feline friend. While you know your cat best, we advise against tummy tickles as it may lead to your kitty accidentally scratching through even the thickest blanket!</p>
                        <p><strong>Dinner time and treats</strong></p>
                        <p>Most cats are fed the same food at the same time, and while this routine has its benefits, it may not provide enough stimulation for your feline friend. Why not spice up mealtime and tap into your cat's natural hunting instincts? Engaging in a food hunt can provide mental stimulation and increase their satisfaction at mealtime. If you're looking for inspiration, check out our post on Feline Food.</p>


